<title>UK: Rexam H1 pre-tax profit slips to 83 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Rexam H1 pre-tax profit slips to 83 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.1		   vs 15.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.1		    vs 6.1</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-excep	83.0		   vs 111.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,154.0		vs 1,146.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Paper and packaging group Rexam Plc said it was cautious about the outlook for the second half of the year.</p>
</text>
